  "synopsis": "On the distant mechanical planet Cybertron, there existed two factions of mechanical organisms that could transform into other mechanisms - Autobots and Decepticons. They waged a prolonged war for possession of an infinite source of Energon - the Cube, which led to the near-total decline of Cybertron. The Cube was eventually lost in space until the leader of the Decepticons, Megatron, learned of its location. The Cube fell to Earth, and Megatron went there but crashed into glaciers where he was trapped for many years. He was found by the researcher Archibald Witwicky, who accidentally activated Megatron's navigation system, and the Cube's coordinates were recorded on his glasses. Decades later, the glasses reached his descendant Sam Witwicky, and now a hunt for him had been opened by the Decepticons. At that time, the Autobots had also arrived on Earth and wanted to find Sam to protect him and obtain the Cube first. Bumblebee, who transformed into a Camaro, was sent to him, which, by a twist of fate, Sam bought as his first car. Now the war between the Transformers will unfold on Earth, and the fate of the planet will depend on who first gains control of the Cube.",
